================================================================================
OPERATING SYSTEMS ASSIGNMENT 2 PROBLEM STATEMENT
Course: CS401 | Due in 5 Days
================================================================================

Objective:
Simulate CPU Scheduling in C or C++. Implement the Round Robin algorithm with
configurable time quantum `q`.

Input Format:
- Line 1: Integer N (number of processes), Integer Q (time quantum).
- Next N lines: ProcessID, ArrivalTime, BurstTime.

Output Format:
- Gantt Chart printed to terminal.
- Process execution order.
- Turnaround Time (TAT) and Waiting Time (WT) per process.
- Average TAT and Average WT.

Submission Requirements:
- Source code in `.cpp` or `.c`.
- PDF report with benchmark tables and screenshot of 3 edge-case tests.
